{"unit_id":"xiaomao361__dsh-jand#card-zh","repo":"xiaomao361/dsh-jand","commit":"8664879442d20b122b634fbd4bda8fb8f33390d1","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jand 是 DSH 的跨设备 Jand 协作插件，通过 DSH 工具创建或加入协作对话、收发和查看持久化消息，并可查询本地会话记录及管理有界任务；Web 设置面板提供 Relay、内核和历史信息。它使用 Jand Relay 传递协作消息，默认地址为 jand.zhou-wei.com；仅当 Relay 限制创建会话时才需要运营方签发的令牌。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:47-84"]}
{"unit_id":"xiaomao361__dsh-jand#card-en","repo":"xiaomao361/dsh-jand","commit":"8664879442d20b122b634fbd4bda8fb8f33390d1","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-jand adds Jand collaboration to DSH. Tools create or join conversations, receive messages, inspect the inbox and manage tasks. A Web panel shows settings and local history. Messages use jand.zhou-wei.com; an operator token is needed only if the Relay restricts conversation creation.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:47-84"]}
