{"unit_id":"xiaomao361__dsh-jand#feature-1","repo":"xiaomao361/dsh-jand","commit":"8664879442d20b122b634fbd4bda8fb8f33390d1","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-jand 的功能「跨设备协作收件箱」：通过 DSH 工具加入协作对话、启动后台接收，并读取尚未确认的持久消息；会话及接收状态保存在本地。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:56-60"]}
